<section class="oauth-flow" aria-label="External account connection sequence">
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Browser to mug shop</strong><span>Connect with the shop's verified identity</span></li>
    <li><strong>Mug shop to provider</strong><span>Save a temporary transaction, then redirect for consent</span></li>
    <li><strong>Provider to mug shop</strong><span>Return code and signed state to the callback</span></li>
    <li><strong>Mug shop</strong><span>Consume the transaction once. Recover the subject and PKCE verifier.</span><aside><strong>Connection stops</strong><span>Transaction missing after restart or on another instance. Begin a new connection.</span></aside></li>
    <li><strong>Mug shop to provider</strong><span>Transaction found: exchange code plus verifier for provider tokens</span></li>
    <li><strong>Secret store</strong><span>Save credentials under the provider and shop subject</span></li>
    <li data-diagram-role="command"><strong>Application command</strong><span>Dispatch connection status and token reference</span></li>
  </ol>
</section>
